		(at 11.43 29.8 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left bottom))
		(uuid "de2ce924-6a14-5779-87f5-a13539901b61")
	)
	(text "pads 3 and 4 only hold the part. R705 keeps the LED data line low while the MCU is in reset."
